Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:07.45,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf86}声{\kf33}は{\kf35}ど{\kf96}こ{\kf66}ま{\kf56}で{\kf150}も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:07.45,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:12.66,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}Mou {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
