Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:12.66,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:18.29,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ma{\kf35}i{\kf29}a{\kf37}ga{\kf28}ru {\kf33}ka{\kf32}ze {\kf66}ni {\kf54}no{\kf141}ri
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:18.29,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}舞{\kf35}い{\kf29}上{\kf37}が{\kf28}る{\kf65}風{\kf66}に{\kf54}乗{\kf141}り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:18.29,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:22.67,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
