Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:28.59,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:28.59,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, if I sleep now, we'll never make the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...don't we go outside for some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys should get some rest if you need it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens, call my cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be pretty much fine for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.46,0:04:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your hand feels like ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't keep your room so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if I turn off the air conditioning, you guys sweat all over the manuscripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard that stress can cause your body temperature to fall, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, about that new job you were mentioning recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's worth taking if it'll cause a drop in the quality of your current work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've never been very strong, physically or mentally, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're making enough just now to put food on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't think there's any need to get greedy with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The public's current interest in my work could easily disappear come next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's always a new generation of artists hitting the scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And people can grow bored with your work just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're way too pessimistic, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a girl, so you should really{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going home to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to bother you all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be bothered to go to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you come out when I called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. It's too hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does that cool you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we make your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.08,0:06:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer holidays have started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We make her lunch together in the morning, and then she goes to a daycare centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to visit Granddad's grave next Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time for the Bon Festival, after all, and your flowers should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:57.21,Notes,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: A Japanese holiday when it is customary to honour the deceased spirits of your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? You don't want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers haven't bloomed yet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, right. I guess they'll take a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about we buy some from a florist this time? We'll take yours once they've bloomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that Granddad would be happy if you brought him bellflowers that you grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But just having you there would make him the happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.07,0:07:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Rin weren't here, I doubt I'd be thinking of Granddad like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:08:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You'll mess it all up if you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is your hair so fine, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About ten, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, this is nostalgic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a ton of them in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop shaking them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here lots of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.90,0:09:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Granddad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I guess Granny's grave is here too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:24.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad's granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granny and Granddad had a child, my mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, she had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! So your mum is Granddad's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means I'm your mother's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! I shouldn't have pointed her in that direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell? But she didn't even come to the funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait here for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull out some of the weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who goes to visit a grave with a guy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?! What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were some sort of stalker...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We happened to come to the graveyard after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was really just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I thought I should let you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that Rin's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's at Granddad's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:12:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's very dear to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't really think very fondly of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and I don't really care about what's going on in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.51,0:12:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no intention of forcing the two of you to meet again, unless she wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to tell me so badly that you chased after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to ask if you wanted to at least secretly get a look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to clean the grave, light some incense and go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so we'll probably be around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Rin's waiting for me. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just be doing what we came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I had something to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.58,0:13:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're being weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.65,0:13:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you getting so worked up for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plant them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a baby any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood ties are amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. She looks just like you, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sense of distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so much like Souichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was really a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess coincidences like this only pop up when it's almost Obon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She turns seven today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Learning about your daughter was a shock, too, but I thought maybe the guy was your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't have a single brain cell in that head of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though that could change in another half-century.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Half... century?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.00,0:15:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's logical to assume that that guy was her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's not such a bad thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone madly in love, it didn't take her long to find somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Granddad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's close by, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... But it's not Granddad's house any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is somebody living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, nobody's living there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It belongs to my uncle on my mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Buddhist altar is there too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll ask my uncle if we can at least take a look around the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.78,0:16:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to take them up on that job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be okay, Maa-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gave her up for the sake of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should be doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You already are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're working harder than anyone needs to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to work so hard that I can't even remember what I had for dinner the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.83,0:16:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on. Even I forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget all of those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.59,0:17:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just the same as it used to be, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.51,0:17:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you've changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.55,0:17:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The dirt is gone, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those bellflowers were so important to Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't mean to just yank them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:18:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even my uncle could tell you Granddad's favourite flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when Winter comes, they wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He probably didn't know that they bloom again in Spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And these stones...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.87,0:18:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't spread them around, the area will become overrun with weeds before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad we got Rin's fragrant olive tree out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But luckily, we have bellflowers for Granddad at our house, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe things changing isn't always a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that grave will always be Granddad's grave, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.34,0:19:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A chocolate cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei, can you do a final check?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really seem like you're pushing yourself too hard this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you say things like that, my hands stop working properly, so stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! All of the nighttime stalls are going to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.97,0:22:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were supposed to meeting at the shrine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum's too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.81,0:22:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump in one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'd meet us at the shrine after she put on her yukata.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.27,0:22:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! The nighttime stalls will close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! It's hard to run in wooden clogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
